# What the code bus must not serve.
#
# Adobe's boilerplate opens this file with `.*`, and that one line is
# deliberately NOT copied here. It would also exclude .well-known/, and
# .well-known/adobe/cloudmanager-challenge.txt is what Cloud Manager fetched to
# verify ownership of this site. Verification can be re-checked at any time and
# losing it would be silent, so every dot file below is named individually and
# nothing dot-prefixed is excluded by accident.
#
# Everything listed here is fetchable at its own path until this file exists.
# That is the point: the site was serving its own package.json and README.

# Node metadata. A site has no reason to publish its manifest or lockfile.
package.json
package-lock.json

# Documentation and internal notes, including the narration notes under media/.
# Nothing on the site reads these: the podcast player's synthesized-audio label
# is a literal in blocks/podcast-player/podcast-player.js, not a fetch.
*.md

# Lint and editor configuration, added for boilerplate parity.
.editorconfig
.eslintignore
.eslintrc.cjs
.stylelintrc.json

# Git, and this file.
.gitignore
.hlxignore

# Build tooling and its assets. tools/sidekick/config.json is deliberately
# absent from this list: the Sidekick fetches it over the code bus and the
# project plugin disappears without it.
tools/assemble-film.py
tools/ensure-git-stub.mjs
tools/firefly-generate.mjs
tools/to-docx.mjs
tools/validate.mjs
tools/assets/*
tools/fonts/*
